{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03996","headline":"上元夜效小庾体 · 高瑾","name":"上元夜效小庾体","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"初年三五夜，相知一两人。\n连镳出巷口，飞毂下池漘。\n灯光恰似月，人面倂如春。\n遨游终未已，相欢待日轮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高瑾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}